      "title": {
        "en": "Independent Scenario Analysis: stop loss",
        "zh": "独立情境分析：将止损设于逻辑失效处而非方便位置"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Analyse both a valid and an invalid interpretation of placing stop losses at logical invalidation rather than convenience using the assigned chart. Compare the evidence, explain the risk boundary, identify what would change your conclusion and state when no trade is preferable.",
